<title>USA: No recommendations on Fed posts to Clinton yet.</title>
<headline>No recommendations on Fed posts to Clinton yet.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>White House advisers have a short list of candidates for the two vacant Federal Reserve Board governor positions but have not yet given President Bill Clinton any formal recommendations, White House spokesman Mike McCurry told reporters on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;They're down to a short list. They're continuing to interview candidates ... but the president has not received any formal recommendations,&quot; McCurry told reporters during his daily briefing.</p>
</text>
